  storyText: "Ice Bath\n\nYou climb into an ice bath. Cables click into your ports. Celestine: \"The dive goes through an old gate near the Blackwall. NetWatch will notice. Be fast.\"\n\n1. Jack in.\n2. Wait - ask Mirage first."
